# Shell scripts must always check out with LF -- CRLF breaks the shebang
# line (`#!/bin/sh` becomes an unrecognized interpreter path), which is
# fatal for scripts Docker mounts straight into a Linux container (e.g.
# docker/db-init/zz-set-role-passwords.sh). Without this, core.autocrlf=true
# on Windows silently corrupts them on checkout.
*.sh text eol=lf
